# Generated by the search-index vite plugin, which writes it on buildStart and
# on dev-server start. The Pages workflow builds before it uploads, so the
# deployed index is always rebuilt from the markdown and a committed copy is
# read by nobody — it only churned on every docs edit and conflicted on merges.
